function adminProfilePage(){let user=currentUser();if(!user||user.role!=='admin')return '';let pending=pendingBeautyVerifications().length;return `${profileHeader('Admin Profile')}${profileIdentity(user,true)}<h2 class="account-section-title">Admin Tools</h2><div class="admin-modules">${ADMIN_MODULES.map(m=>`<button class="admin-module ${m[4]==='beauty-verifications'?'functional':''}" onclick="${m[4]==='beauty-verifications'?`nav('beauty-verifications')`:`showPlaceholder('${m[1]}')`}"><span class="profile-module-icon">${m[0]}</span><div><h3>${m[1]}</h3>${m[2]?`<b>${m[2]}</b>`:''}<p>${m[3]}</p></div>${m[4]==='beauty-verifications'&&pending?`<em>${pending} Pending</em>`:''}<i>›</i></button>`).join('')}</div><h2 class="account-section-title">Account</h2><div class="account-list">${accountRow('♙','Edit Profile','showEditProfileDialog()')}${accountRow('⚙','Account Settings',`nav('account-settings')`)}</div><button class="account-signout" onclick="signOut()"><span>↪</span>Sign Out<i>›</i></button>`}
